{"name":"t:sections.footer.name","type":"footer","sections":{"ss_simple_faq_nA9dTL":{"type":"ss-simple-faq","blocks":{"text_Pa9py4":{"type":"text","settings":{"question":"Do you ship overseas?","answer":"<p>We now ship to EU countries with 4-6 day tracked shipping. Up to a value of €150, your orders will be sent with duties pre-paid. If you need help with placing an order, please contact us via email: info@coszus.com so that we can assist you.<\/p>"}},"text_8GEVpa":{"type":"text","settings":{"question":"How long will it take to get my order?","answer":"<p>It depends on what shipping option you select. <br\/><\/p><p>UK Orders - Orders placed before 3pm on Monday-Friday will be sent out same day from our UK based fulfilment centre. For Special delivery orders must be placed before 3pm Monday=Friday in order to arrive next day. <br\/><\/p><p>EU orders - 4-6 days from when the order is placed. If purchased before 3pm London time the order should be dispatched on the same day (except weekends). <\/p>"}},"text_KgFCFR":{"type":"text","settings":{"question":"How do I track my order?","answer":"<p>After placing your order you will receive an order confirmation email which gives you a link to track the status of your order. We also link your details to the shipment so you will receive updates directly from the courier. <\/p>"}},"text_wwxb4M":{"type":"text","settings":{"question":"What payment methods do you accept?","answer":"<p>We accept all major credit and debit cards.<br\/><br\/>We also offer Klarna and Clearpay for UK customers - please note that buy now pay later options are available at the last stage of checkout. They will not show as an option if you are checking out via Shop Pay & Apple Pay.<\/p>"}},"text_eRLGbX":{"type":"text","settings":{"question":"Anything else?","answer":"<p>Just drop us an email to info@coszus.com<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["text_Pa9py4","text_8GEVpa","text_KgFCFR","text_wwxb4M","text_eRLGbX"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":["h1 {font-size: 12px;}"